" style=3D"height: 2.7em;"></span><span class=3D"sizing reset-size6 size3 m=
tight"><span class=3D"mord mtight">3</span></span></span></span></span></sp=
an></span></span></span></span></span>, which means our counts array will h=
ave a maximum size of <span class=3D"katex"><span class=3D"katex-mathml"><m=
ath xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn=
>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=3D"application/x-tex">=
10^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=3D"katex-html" aria-=
